    </profile>
    <profile name="Mine Plough" id="70ddb643-fc34-f4cb-79e9-20332edf61f8" hidden="false" page="178" publicationId="a03f3b3e--pubN67511" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Wargear Item">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Roll 2D6 for Dangerous Terrain tests - only fails on a result of double 1. Whenever the vehicle moves through an enemy Infantry unit as part of a Tank Shock move and is not destroyed, the enemy unit takes D3+1 S2 AP- hits. In special mission with land mines &amp; booby traps, the Mine Plough grants a 4+ Invul Sv against such attacks, and clears minefields it passes through on a 5+</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
